<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-ENGLAND-ITALY CLASH TO BE SHOWN LIVE ON GERMAN TV.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND-ITALY CLASH TO BE SHOWN LIVE ON GERMAN TV.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>England's clash with Italy in a World Cup soccer qualifier next week will be shown live on German television.</p>
<p>It will be the first time that a qualifier not involving Germany will be broadcast live in the country, the public television network WDR said on Tuesday.</p>
